## Requirement trace

One row per requirement, quoted **verbatim** from the source. Do not paraphrase
and do not merge two sentences into one row — paraphrase is where requirements
go missing. If the source says a thing three times, it is still one row, but it
is not zero rows.

`proven by` must start with `spec:`, `browser:` or `waived:`. Any value naming
a path must point at a file that exists.

| id | requirement (verbatim from source) | satisfied in | proven by |
|----|------------------------------------|--------------|-----------|
| R-1 | "Do not charge user credit card for cancelled order's order_variation(s)" | app/services/capture.rb:88 | spec: spec/services/capture_spec.rb |
| R-2 | "Add budget badge to the top of the modal" | src/Modal/Step2.jsx:41 | browser: loops/{{LOOP_SLUG}}/evidence/step2-badge.png |
| R-3 | "Display the co-payment delta on step 5" | | |

