## Notes

- Ledger rows in `STATE.md` carry their requirement id in the existing `ref`
  column (`R-14 · CAT-10040`) — do not add a column, the dashboard renderer
  reads a fixed schema.
- Evidence files live in `loops/{{LOOP_SLUG}}/evidence/`. A screenshot or GIF
  committed there is what turns "I checked it in a browser" into something the
  gate can verify.
- Rows are append-only. A requirement that turns out not to apply is `waived:`
  with a reason, never deleted.
